  "answer_text": "It looks like there are several different entities that go by the name **\"Chase Capital Services\"** or similar names. Here is an overview of the most notable ones:\n\n---\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfe6 JPMorgan Chase \u2013 Capital & Commercial Banking Services\nChase offers a broad range of financial services including credit cards, mortgages, commercial banking, auto loans, investing, and retirement planning. On the commercial and capital side, they provide tailored credit, financing, treasury, and payment solutions for businesses of all sizes and commercial real estate, backed by the strength and stability of J.P. Morgan, with dedicated experts delivering industry-specific guidance.\n\nThey help clients achieve their long-term strategic goals through financing, liquidity, payments, risk management, and investment banking solutions, including M&A, capital raising, and risk management for a broad range of corporations, institutions, and governments.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \ud83c\udfe0 Chase Capital Holdings, LLC (Atlanta, GA)\nChase Capital Holdings, LLC is a trusted partner in investment real estate financing \u2014 a family-owned and operated boutique lending business based in Atlanta with 20+ years of expertise in the industry, catering to the needs of experienced real estate investors throughout the Southeastern United States, offering quick and straightforward funding solutions for residential real estate investments.\n\n---\n\n### 3. \ud83c\udf31 Chase Capital (Canada)\nChase Capital is a private capital platform dedicated to investing in, advising, and helping unique businesses grow into dynamic platforms across Canada and other regions globally, bringing valuable capital and trusted industry expertise to acquisitions and partnerships with existing owners and operators, and executing nimble and creative transactions designed to maximize benefits for both existing stakeholders and investors.\n\nThey drive success in key growth sectors such as energy transition, waste & resource recovery infrastructure, and food & agricultural production, with a focus on investments and partnerships in the energy sector.\n\n---\n\n### 4. \ud83d\udcc8 Chase Capital Partners (Closed)\nThis firm's broad platform positioned them to deliver extensive product capabilities \u2014 including lending, treasury services, investment banking, and asset management \u2014 to meet their clients' U.S. and international financial needs. However, Chase Capital Partners is permanently closed.\n\n---\n\nCould you clarify which **Chase Capital Services** you are referring to? For example:\n- Are you looking for **JPMorgan Chase's** business/capital services?\n- A **real estate lending** firm?\n- A **private equity/investment** company?\n\nThis will help me give you more specific and relevant information!",
